  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 92b2c8003586277498a007ee213cc22b, type: 3}
  m_Name: Log - Two of us
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::FloppyData
  diskName: Log - Two of us
  logTitle: Unidentified Growth
  author: Capt. Daniel Mercer
  shipName: 038-Elysium
  dateRecorded: '[Mission timestamp TBD]'
  logText: 'Found something unusual during my inspection this morning. Some kind
    of growth in the corner of the aft compartment. Pale, almost translucent. Looks
    like a cross between a spiderweb and a fungal colony.

    I haven''t the faintest
    idea how it got aboard. Everything was sterilized before launch, and I haven''t
    brought back anything from the surface that should''ve survived decontamination.

    I''ll
    take a sample tomorrow. Maybe it''s something I tracked in without realizing.

    There''s
    something else, though.

    I could''ve sworn I heard someone speaking while
    I was inspecting it. Just a few words, too quiet to make out. I thought I''d
    left a recording playing somewhere, but every speaker I checked was silent.

    I
    suppose thirty thousand years away from home is enough to make anyone start hearing
    things.

    Still, I don''t much like the idea of hearing another voice aboard
    this ship.

    Not when I know perfectly well I''m alone.'
